qcrew                                               [?] help
  [1 Projects]  2 Inbox   3 Sessions   4 Settings           
------------------------------------------------------------
> Projects                                                  
  #= Help ===============================================#  
> | [qcrew]  service-guide   project-guide   session-gui |  
  |                                                      |  
  | qcrew is a program with a terminal interface for     |  
  | working with several AI agent command line tools,    |  
  | such as Claude Code and Codex, in parallel across    |  
  | several projects.                                    |  
  |                                                      |  
  | Commands:                                            |  
  | - qcrew, qcrew tui: open the terminal interface (at  |  
  |   a terminal; without one qcrew shows this           |  
> |   overview), see qcrew tui --help                    |  
  | - qcrew version: print the version                   |  
  | - qcrew service start|stop|status: control the       |  
  |   background service, see the service-guide topic    |  
  | - qcrew project add|list|remove: register the        |  
  |   directories qcrew works in, see the project-guide  |  
  |   topic                                              |  
  | - qcrew session start|list|stop|attach: run agent    |  
  | lines 1-16 of 44                                     |  
  |                                                      |  
  | left/right topic  up/down scroll  esc/? close        |  
  #======================================================#  
                                                            
enter sessions  / search  f full screen  r reload  1-4 area 
q quit                                   up/down choose  1/2
